1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Birth/baptism:'''
2 CONT There are no church records for Lund from before 1724 or for Helleland from before 1713. According to the probate after her mother, dated 24-09-1738, Gunhild was the oldest daughter of this marriage. Her younger sister, Ingeborg J
2 CONC akobsdatter Øygrei, was buried 24-04-1763, 50 years old, thus born about 1713. Gunhild's parents were living at Moi farm, Lund, Rogaland, from about 1703/1705 until about 1715 "Lunds historie", p. 371). Gunhild married I time 25-1
2 CONC 0-1722. Thus, Gunhild must have been born '''before''' the parents moved to Øygrei, and '''Gunhild was thus most likely born at Moi''', probably between 1703 and 1707. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Marriage record I (25-10-1722):'''
2 CONT Helleland sokneprestkontor, SAST/A-101810: Ministerialbok nr. A 1 /1, 1713-1761, s. 28. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20070618620364
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Marriage record II (27-12-1724):'''
2 CONT Helleland sokneprestkontor, SAST/A-101810: Ministerialbok nr. A 1 /1, 1713-1761, s. 35. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20070618620371
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Marriage record III (27-05-1731):'''
2 CONT Helleland sokneprestkontor, SAST/A-101810: Ministerialbok nr. A 1 /1, 1713-1761, s. 48.https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20070618620384
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Marriage record IV (16-10-1742):'''
2 CONT Helleland sokneprestkontor, SAST/A-101810: Ministerialbok nr. A 1 /1, 1713-1761, s. 71. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20070618620406
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Death/burial record:'''
2 CONT Not found. The last known child of Gunhild was born at Øygrei, and baptized 04-10-1747. Her husband remarried 06-11-1748. Gunhild must thus have died during the period April 1747 - October 1748, probably in conjunction with giving
2 CONC  birth to her last child. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Skoskatten 1711 (Gunhild is probably one of the 5 children listed with her parents at Moi at the time):'''
2 CONT Rentekammeret inntil 1814, Reviderte regnskaper, Fogderegnskap, RA/EA-4092/R46/L2735: Fogderegnskap Jæren og Dalane, 1711, s. 439. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/rk10081305100447
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record after her mother (24-09-1738; Marta had died and Gunhild Jakobsdatter, married to Ole Pedersen Øygrei, is listed among the heirs):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, SAST/A-100306/5/50BA/L0006B: SKIFTEPROTOKOLL, 1722-1739, s. 642b-643a. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106680651
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://urn.nb.no/URN:NBN:no-nb_digibok_2019010848504 Lund historie I, Gårdens og slektens liv], Rusdal, side 679, nr. III
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lund historie I, Gårdens og slektens liv, Rusdal, side 679, nr. III'''
2 CONT Omund Rolfsen. F. 1710, 48 år 1758, fikk skj. 18-7-1764.
2 CONT G. I g. 1742 m. Gunhild Jacobsdatter, dtr. av Jacob Kristiansen Øgrei, Helleland, og enke etter Ole Pedersen Øgrei. De fikk kgl. bev. for ekteskap den 20-7-1742, da Omund var tremenning med hennes første mann.
2 CONT G. II g. 6-11-1748 m. Ragnhild Evensdatter Eik. De fikk kgl. bev. for ekteskap da de var søskenbarn.
2 CONT Sk. 30-05-1863. Et godt bo. Av smykker finner vi et sølvbelte.
2 CONT Barn i I ekteskap:
2 CONT * 1. Ole, se nedenfor.
2 CONT * 2. Rolf, f. 1747, 11 år 1758.
2 CONT Barn i II ekteskap:
2 CONT * 3. Valborg, dpt. 8-5-1755, grl. 17 s. trin 1760.
2 CONT * 4. Ågot, dpt. 19-5-1757.
2 CONT * 5. Gunhild, dpt. 7-9-1749, g. 11-4-1771 m. Johannes Osen, Sirdal. <<Mandhaftig soldat>>. Se Rusdal, br. nr. 3.
2 CONT * 6. Even, f. 1853, 10 år 1863.
