2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record after her mother (01-07-1712; The mother had died, and Ågot Omundsdatter, married to Eivind Lindeland, is listed among her heirs):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, SAST/A-100306/5/50BA/L0004: SKIFTEPROTOKOLL, 1708-1714, s. 327b-328a. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106660629
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record after her I husband (09-10-1719; The husband had died, and Ågot is listed among her heirs):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, SAST/A-100306/5/50BA/L0005: SKIFTEPROTOKOLL. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106670247
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT 	Ho var gift med Eivind Osmundsen Guddal og dei budde på Lindeland br 6-7 i Sirdal
