2 CONT that a new bridge was put over the coulee north of us. Four enor-
2 CONT
2 CONT mous poles were driven into the earth to make a secure footing. It
2 CONT
2 CONT was a great improvement to get a new bridge.
2 CONT
2 CONT    rinte isflying by and we have come to the memorable year 1908
