2 CONT lost sinner, and Ole bowed his knees before the living God in rfpen-
2 CONT
2 CONT tance. A revelation from the Ileavenly Father convinced Ole that he
2 CONT
2 CONT was God's child and this became a milestone in his life. It was a
2 CONT
2 CONT living covenant to him which has been at the center of all his deal-
2 CONT
2 CONT ing since. This inner life with Cod has helped him in difficult
2 CONT
2 CONT tinics as well as sickness and trouble (savn).
