2 NOTE I have so many good memories of Hank.  He was such a nice person and so kind and playful with us bratty  little kids when he was probably a teenager.  He and also his brother, our Uncle Ray would sometimes stay at our house in sto
3 CONC rmy weather in order to be closer to the highschool in Edinburg.   We spent a lot of our Sundays (good weather) at Grandpa's farm, and always enjoyed our uncles!    igb    
