2 CONT ----
2 CONT Perhaps Bernt was the son of crofter Asbjørn Brynildsen Håskog (at Hidra, Flekkefjord, Vest-Agder)? He had a son named Bernt, baptized 14-10-1792. See  [https://www.nb.no/items/01c03a614632cfcb7b48560e954e1ebb?page=71 "Bygdebok fo
2 CONC r Åna Sira og Berrefjord" (p.68)], and [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/census/person/pf01058347001148 Folketelling 1801 for 1111P Sokndal prestegjeld, Tellingskrets: 001, Bosted land: 0052 Haaskow]. Yet, '''please note that no evid
2 CONC ence may exist to prove that these are one and the same person'''.
2 CONT ----
