2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''She was NOT a daughter father of Bjørn Bessesen Steine/ Osen,''' as claimed by both [https://www.nb.no/items/931a4ffb452f6a2306de08a17b4d6987?page=418 "Lunds historie"] and [https://www.nb.no/items/7030d184bbc50ed3e1dac0748f60b
2 CONC 679?page=485 "Heskestad sokn: gard, ætt og folk"]. She was a daughter of Bjørn Asbjørnsen Osen from Sirdal. She died in 1762, at the age of 47, thus born  about 1715, i.e. many years after the death of Bjørn Bessesen Steine/ Osen.
2 CONC  See also her marriage record at Tonstad. '''She is NOT mentioned in the probate after Anna Ellefsdatter Steine, the I wife of Bjørn Bessesen Steine/Osen, [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106650550 dated 26-09-1684]'''.
2 CONT ----
