2 CONT Helleland sokneprestkontor, SAST/A-101810: Ministerialbok nr. A 1 /1, 1713-1761, s. 92. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20070618620421
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Burial record (22-10-1765; Omund d.e. is claimed to be 48 years, 9 months and 8 days old at death years old at death):'''
2 CONT Helleland sokneprestkontor, SAST/A-101810: Ministerialbok nr. A 2 /1, 1762-1791, s. 7.https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20070618630032
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1758 Sjeleregister at Helleland (Omund is listed with his wife at Høyland, and is claimed to be 37 years old at the time. They are listed with their daughter "Abbelone Ommundsdatter", 13 years old, and female servant"Marit Jaco
2 CONC bsdatter", 24 years old. This must be Apelone Jakobsdatter, as Randi and Omund were married in 1651, i.e. the daughter of Randi with her I husband Jakob Olsen; and Marte Jakobsdatter, daughter of Jakob Olsen and his I wife Apelone
2 CONC  Skulesdatter; after whom Apelone Jakobsdatter was named):'''
2 CONT Fylkesmannen i Rogaland, SAST/A-101928/99/3/325/325CA/L0017: SJELEREGISTER JÆREN OG DALANE PRESTEGJELD, 1758, s. 27. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20060620030200
2 CONT ----
