2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record (13-07-1717; Karl had died whild away in military service at Halden, Østfold [during the Great Northern War]; his heirs were listed as 7 siblings, no mention of any wife/widow):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, SAST/A-100306/5, 1714-1722, s. 235. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20110328660235
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Probate record (13-07-1717; Karl was dead; his heirs were listed as 7 siblings, no mention of any wife/widow):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, SAST/A-100306/5/50BA/L0005: SKIFTEPROTOKOLL. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106670134
