2 CONT ----
2 CONT [https://www.nb.no/items/931a4ffb452f6a2306de08a17b4d6987?page=568 "Lunds historie"] states that he was married to a widow named Tøri Jonsdatter. '''This appears to be incorrect'''. There is no mention of a wife or widow in [https
2 CONC ://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20110328660235 his probate]. It seems that "Lunds historie" has confused a wife with his sister Tora Jonsdatter, married to Henrik Gundlefsen who was running the farm in his absence.
2 CONT ----
