1 NAME Torkel Tolleivsen /Hammersmark/
2 GIVN Torkel Tolleivsen
2 SURN Hammersmark
2 _MARNM Hammersmark
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT DEC 1753
2 PLAC Hammersmark Gard, Tonstad, Bakke, Vest-Agder, Norway
