2 CONT Is there any '''evidence''' that Asbjørn Helgesen Bjordal/ Eik (Eik) had a daughter married to a Peder Torkelsen Gakkestad? [https://www.nb.no/items/931a4ffb452f6a2306de08a17b4d6987?page=675 "Lunds historie"] as well as [https://e
2 CONC ivinds.net/5-rusdal/ "Gårdsprosjektet, Lund 1519-1619"] (12. Peder), suggests that Peder probably got married to a daughter of Torkel Rusdal.
2 CONT ----
