1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Sigbjørn Tollaksen Rusdal (Espetveit) must have been married more than once.''' "Lunds historie" states that Rolf was a half-brother of the other siblings. Åse d.y. seems to have been born some time during the 1
2 CONC 640s (as her older sister Åse d.e., according to [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20070621630151 her burial record dated 20-04-1727], was 90 years old at death, thus born about 1637), and can't have been the mother of Tollak ([htt
2 CONC ps://www.digitalarkivet.no/ft10041010271060 50 years old in 1701]) or the other older children of Sigbjørn. Rolf seems to be named after the father of Åse d.y., and it is likely that he was her son. Johannes ([https://www.digitala
2 CONC rkivet.no/ft10041010271059 16 years old in 1701]) was born after Rolf ([https://www.digitalarkivet.no/ft10041010271059 18 years old in 1701]), and was thus most likely also her son. The other children are, based on their ages, lik
2 CONC ely to be born by the first unknown wife of Sigbjørn.
2 CONT ----
