1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Marriage record I (21-01-1740):'''
2 CONT Helleland sokneprestkontor, SAST/A-101810: Ministerialbok nr. A 1 /1, 1713-1761, s. 67. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20070618620402
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Marriage record II (02-06-1751):'''
2 CONT Helleland sokneprestkontor, SAST/A-101810: Ministerialbok nr. A 1 /1, 1713-1761, s. 92. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20070618620421
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1758 Sjeleregister at Helleland (Randi is listed [without name] with her husband Omund at Høyland, and is claimed to be 50 years old at the time. They are listed with their daughter "Abbelone Ommundsdatter", 13 years old, and f
2 CONC emale servant"Marit Jacobsdatter", 24 years old. This must be Apelone Jakobsdatter, as Randi and Omund were married in 1651, i.e. the daughter of Randi with her I husband Jakob Olsen; and Marte Jakobsdatter, daughter of Jakob Olse
2 CONC n and his I wife Apelone Skulesdatter; after whom Apelone Jakobsdatter was named):'''
2 CONT Fylkesmannen i Rogaland, SAST/A-101928/99/3/325/325CA/L0017: SJELEREGISTER JÆREN OG DALANE PRESTEGJELD, 1758, s. 27. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20060620030200
2 CONT ----
