2 CONT Katedralskolen i Bergen:
2 CONT Meltzer Thomas Sebastian Hall 12. Marts 1816, foreldre Fredr. Meltzer Fransk Consul i Bergen og Margaritha Stub innskrevet 1828 i l. CL 1829-33: 3.43-2.41-2.75-2.04-2.50 -
2 CONT
2 CONT Bor hos bror Fredrik i Christiania i 1865. 50 år ugift infanterikaptein.
2 CONT
2 CONT Eide Enebakkvn 37 fra 1867, http://www.valerenga.org/enebakkveien.htm Samme husholderske som hos broren i 1865. Greta Olofsdotter f. 04.07.1829 i Sillerud i Sverige. Kalte seg Grethe Olsen i Norge (telling 75)
2 CONT
2 CONT I 1875 bodde han i Qværnergaten 15, Svendengen, Aker. Pensjonert kaptein.
2 CONT
2 CONT Down to the right: http://arkivverket.no/URN:sk_read/27262/67/?size=big&mode=0 Reported by Army surgeon Aboten who sent the note . The will shows that the entire fortune will be shared by 2 sons of his brother, except 2000,00 kr g
2 CONC iven to his housekeeper Grethe Olsen. One of the nephews Johan Meltzer is in Spain. Grethe's address is known. (her part is worth 22 000,- USD today) He had probably no contact with his son in Illinois.
