2 CONC er husband Torleiv. Lovingly missed by her son Sven Roy (Inger); grandchildren John (Gwen), Kaaren (Craig), Kristian (Lisa); great-grandchildren Shelby, Paige, Sarah, and Zoe; step-grandchildren Jens (Laura) and Lars (Cheryl); ste
2 CONC p-great-grandchildren Lindsay and Kurtis and many family and friends in Norway and Canada. Many thanks for the wonderful care Mom received from the Doctors and Careworkers. Memorial Service held Wednesday, June 22, 2005 at First C
2 CONC hristian Reform Church, 2670 Victoria Drive, Vancouver, BC. Published in the Vancouver Sun / The Province, 06/21/05.
